1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,966
Here is the summary table.

2
00:00:01,966 --> 00:00:05,026
Pressure at a fixed temperature: no effect.

3
00:00:05,026 --> 00:00:11,497
Temperature: the speed rises as root T. Humidity: a slight increase.

4
00:00:11,497 --> 00:00:13,802
Wind: adds as a vector.

5
00:00:13,802 --> 00:00:19,908
And loudness and pitch have no effect at all, because the speed is a property of the medium.

